# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# FastBeat .gitignore
#
# WARNING: never ignore a whole module directory (e.g. a bare `/app`).
# Doing so silently drops every NEW file created under it. `git status` will
# not warn you, because ignored files are never reported as untracked, and
# files tracked *before* the rule was added keep looking fine -- so the repo
# appears healthy while it rots.
#
# That exact mistake (a bare `/app` on line 7) left
# `audio/AudioEffectsManager.kt` and `ui/components/EqualizerSheet.kt`
# unversioned while already-committed code imported them, producing a
# `master` branch that did not compile.
#
# Rule: ignore build OUTPUT directories and machine-local config only.
# Never a source root, and never a broad extension glob (`*.txt`) that could
# swallow a source or fixture file.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Gradle / build output ---
.gradle
/build
# NOT `/app` -- see the warning above. Only the build output directory.
# Redundant with the nested `app/.gitignore`, kept deliberately so the fence
# survives deletion of that file.
/app/build
app/release
app/release/baselineProfiles
/captures
.externalNativeBuild
.cxx

# --- Machine-local config (absolute SDK paths; must never be committed) ---
local.properties
/local.properties

# --- IDE ---
*.iml
/.idea/caches
/.idea/libraries
/.idea/modules.xml
/.idea/workspace.xml
/.idea/navEditor.xml
/.idea/assetWizardSettings.xml
/.idea/deploymentTargetDropDown.xml
/.idea/shelf

# --- OS ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Transient build / tooling scratch output ---
# Explicit names and narrow globs only. A blanket `*.txt` was previously here
# and would have swallowed `baseline-prof.txt` (P5-E) plus any future test
# fixture data under `app/src/test/resources`.
build_info_output.txt
build_stacktrace.txt
output.md
*.tmp
